OL,3,GNEWSAFree electric blanket tests return
OL,4,Afor autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the summer heatwave across
OL,7,FEngland, thoughts are turning to autumn
OL,8,Fand one local authority is urging
OL,9,Fpeople to check their electric blankets
OL,10,Fafter more than a third of those tested
OL,11,Fby the council last year failed safety
OL,12,Ftests.
OL,14,FOxfordshire County Council said it
OL,15,Ftested 920 electric blankets at its
OL,16,Ffree events held across the county in
OL,17,F2025.
OL,19,FIt said 338 of those tested failed
OL,20,Fsafety assessments - a failure rate of
OL,21,F37%.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
