OL,3,GNEWSAFree electric blanket tests return
OL,4,Afor autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Gregory, the authority's public
OL,7,Fhealth and inequalities lead, said: "If
OL,8,Fthe condition of a blanket is allowed
OL,9,Fto deteriorate, there is a risk it
OL,10,Fcould become faulty, posing a danger of
OL,11,Finjury or fire."
